menu "WUPIO Drivers"
	depends on AW_BSP

config AW_WUPIO
	tristate "WUPIO Support for Allwinner SoCs"
	depends on AW_BSP
	help
	  If you say Y here, you will get support for the WUPIO found on
	  Allwinner SoCs.

config AW_WUPIO_KEYBOARD_GPIO
	tristate "GPIO Buttons With WUPIO Support"
	depends on GPIOLIB || COMPILE_TEST
	help
	  This driver implements support for buttons connected
	  to GPIO pins of various CPUs (and some other chips) With WUPIO Support.

	  Say Y here if your device has buttons connected
	  directly to such GPIO pins.  Your board-specific
	  setup logic must also provide a platform device,
	  with configuration data saying which GPIOs are used.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here: the
	  module will be called gpio_keys.

endmenu

